recommendation:
Add the missing time-based check in forceInclusion:

if (l1BlockAndTime[0] + delayBlocks_ >= block.number) revert ForceIncludeBlockTooSoon();
// Add this:
if (l1BlockAndTime[1] + delaySeconds_ >= block.timestamp) revert ForceIncludeTimeTooSoon();

Both conditions should be independently enforced, requiring both the block delay AND the time delay to have passed.

